        "entry_type": "decision",
        "text": "Date logic: For indexing, if an episode's start date is zero, we fall back to the end date. Also used `time.RFC3339` for string serialization in the `date` unindexed column since `time.Time` support in Go's `sql` package may behave unexpectedly without proper mapping, whereas text is highly deterministic in SQLite."
